      <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="3"><dynexp formula="C23MinusOK = And(C23valid,C23MinusPile &gt;= Basis.Clear,C23MinusWall &gt;= 0 in,C23L*Cos(Basis.TestAngle) &gt;= C23d+Envelope)" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" showresult="True" showformula="True"><expbody>C23MinusOK = And(C23valid,C23MinusPile &gt;= Basis.Clear,C23MinusWall &gt;= 0 in,C23L*Cos(Basis.TestAngle) &gt;= C23d+Envelope)</expbody><expresult> = false</expresult></dynexp></paragraph>
